{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB性感女星白雲（Snowy）自2021年與建築師前夫江俊霖離婚後，近年積極經營社交平台及潛水事業，上月初她高調宣布迎來第二春，大方認愛年僅22歲的德國籍機師男友Fabian，二人相差16年的異國姊弟戀打得火熱，更不時在社交平台高調放閃！日前白雲獲邀現身沙田馬場出席年度盛事「莎莎婦女銀袋日2026」，以一襲粉紅色絲質低胸吊帶裙上陣，更開心宣布自己第5度拉頭馬，霸氣自爆命格「超旺夫」！</p><figure><img alt=\"白雲形象性感。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184857633593495552928301.jpeg/QvZNhv_loSf7lqEA2UgEOm2FZLF6KBEIJ4e2-SeHtvk\"/><figcaption>白雲形象性感。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白雲形象性感。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822170056134656106294.jpeg/QfKU47DAN3FqFgr8jPukXVLQplw1caUlp5XGuaeVxrk\"/><figcaption>白雲形象性感。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白雲大方認愛22歲外籍機師。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184856917718077440615732.jpeg/yY7C7p1uk9LbZbOHhXrxApeSpCgR47oMvDmS9rw5kvY\"/><figcaption>白雲大方認愛22歲外籍機師。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"二人外遊放閃。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184857153278709760856740.jpeg/IGpMCLLHIzK8Ed77BSSa1BdAWBxq9U3xSv4Iw0r-CMM\"/><figcaption>二人外遊放閃。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姊弟戀。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822199043362816843216.jpeg/TZzsfvzVgOP4rQl-X0_EONzFs2oGw60MxJD5c8SQ-XM\"/><figcaption>姊弟戀。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822196174327808389260.jpeg/iIqciyEcuHEPVnlA-FGA3JWvbnuQMQzS2v6LDdr-iw0\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出雙入對。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822193565339648198726.jpeg/OMB4EkKVRTvKNTYAT3g0rYcAnV6C_znk-lr4hPpa-IQ\"/><figcaption>出雙入對。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><p>白雲性感現身馬場第5次拉頭馬　自爆命格超旺</p><p>白雲當日盛裝出席馬場盛事，身穿粉紅色絲質吊帶長裙的她，大騷傲人豐滿上圍及S形曲線，頭上戴著粉色羽毛禮帽，頸戴雙層珍珠鏈，手拎白色迷你Chanel手袋，散發優雅名媛氣息。除了造型搶鏡之外，白雲今次到訪馬場更收穫豐富，再度拉頭馬，她難掩興奮地寫道：「第5次拉頭馬😍 八字師傅說過我的命格很旺周圍人的財運😎真的，每任男朋友我都幫他們賺到錢😌#ladiespurseday #莎莎婦女銀袋日2026 🐴💘」相中見她與好友留影，又走到草地跑道及大屏幕前興奮張開雙臂打卡，更隨馬主及親友一同影大合照，春風滿面！</p><figure><img alt=\"白雲性感現身馬場。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821964258414592576901.jpeg/h-RSwkpljlbE8rgITRtp39gwdDIYoKIqJEIoFCRCKBQ\"/><figcaption>白雲性感現身馬場。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白雲性感現身馬場。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821961284521984476239.jpeg/lGclB7GFUZIJ4AS07uOF98EEPg_q7V4b7IO-ZOyDvmQ\"/><figcaption>白雲性感現身馬場。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"春風滿面！（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821987042267136467592.jpeg/FBX778rtXNQxFGigOBzw72J-QyEb5AHaVPrT3FT609w\"/><figcaption>春風滿面！（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"春風滿面！（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821984106123264430765.jpeg/B_z7OhUGmDFw6GpH3zUnrDbDfIFbXHqeTA8_EUwPPxE\"/><figcaption>春風滿面！（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白雲同梁茵。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821980620525568364857.jpeg/5HZ5qHq-a-_589VKuzdeUQPtB_ORa5NuCDOmkggzppI\"/><figcaption>白雲同梁茵。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬合照。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821977407557632935764.jpeg/0AcsoXPeQL0oJ4gGHv5cKFCk8Ybf74u7ZfwdBGX8HQQ\"/><figcaption>大曬合照。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第5次拉頭馬。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196821974232338432512896.jpeg/d2dWAPFUXDFQ4_uCO7wdcjAbvGDzjv2Nt0S4ZLdEuGQ\"/><figcaption>第5次拉頭馬。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><p>白雲高調認戀22歲德國小鮮肉　周遊列國頻頻放閃極甜蜜</p><p>白雲與建築師前夫江俊霖曾有過一段五年婚姻，有指因男方家人不滿她經常分享性感照，加上我行我素的性格，成為離婚的導火線。離婚後，白雲懶理外界目光，繼續堅持做自己，她曾發文澄清：「我是一個非常特立獨行和自我意識很強的人，我從來不跟任何會嫌我性感有問題的男人交往，甚至做朋友。」上月初白雲高調公開與22歲德國籍機師男友的新戀情，兩人感情發展一日千里，經常周遊列國，大方親吻擁抱，甜度爆燈！</p><figure><img alt=\"相當震撼。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260627/1147642465898074112901865.jpeg/2fLXL9YuK4naMWDCEjv4psqZnEAjAAhuYBMcHWATHB0\"/><figcaption>相當震撼。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"堅持做自己。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184857635959214080951406.jpeg/63jCfO6a3f4SduSvJXkFB9-wzSbaUS6JWMvC9VjLwvU\"/><figcaption>堅持做自己。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"懶理外界目光。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822167702999040481536.jpeg/WtVjv12VQtViduNtp8v5Y8eHIqnX9G4nW9OHj1vTh48\"/><figcaption>懶理外界目光。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬傲人身材。（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822187764355072026497.jpeg/imMz9QcF3-XgRg_9Akfoc0kEgoMwwjQtUEHhTVBB4U0\"/><figcaption>大曬傲人身材。（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"放閃！（IG@snowybai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196822191266729984482905.jpeg/NB2qAFZBPe-hAA0vzm-oVZ_-yIEo6q-Dxkye6MZMnug\"/><figcaption>放閃！（IG@snowybai）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:35.801351+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1074,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T12:30:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:12.579902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:12.579902+00:00","content_hash":"c1be7a4d127aa1025afe2aa1e015c4eb26ff68fab889bd2efb341727799330ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}